    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs while ensuring the quality of service expected, our can propose cost-optimization strategies such as process improvements, efficient resource allocation, and potential renegotiation of rates with subcontractors." ;
