    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we leverage we AI capabilities, including LLMs and RAG, to develop a solution that meets these requirements while providing explainability and transparency for the recommendations or proposals issued? we can leverage our AI capabilities, including LLMs and RAG to develop an intelligent assistance tool that utilizes large language models (LLMs) and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to assist agents in agents daily missions. we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned on the client's dataset to provide accurate and relevant responses. we have experience with fine-tuning methods such as LoRA, QLoRA, and full fine-tune on domain corpus, which can help improve Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To facilitate access to information, we can implement a RAG system that retrieves relevant documents or passages from internal procedures and applicable regulation, and then uses the LLM to generate answers or proposals. our AI capabilities, including LLMs and RAG include retrieval strategies such as dense vector semantic search, BM25 sparse search, and hybrid search, which can help retrieve the most relevant information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve answer quality, we can utilize we explainability methods, including source citation, chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME. our explainability methods, including source citation, chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME can provide transparency into the recommendations or proposals issued by the system, allowing agents to understand the context and reasoning behind the answers. we also have experience with quantization methods such as INT8, INT4 (GPTQ), and GGUF, which can help reduce the model's size and improve inference speed, thereby reducing processing times. we average accuracy gain from fine-tuning is around 12%, which can help improve the overall quality of the answers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we can ensure that the solution meets the client's requirements for explainability and transparency by providing interfaces of API type, allowing for easy integration with existing systems of information, business softwares, electronic management of documents, and user directories. we can also guarantee high availability, with a target of 99.9%, and ensure that the system responds within 2 seconds to current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, we AI capabilities, including LLMs and RAG, can be leveraged to develop an intelligent assistance tool that meets the client's requirements for improving answer quality, reducing processing times, and providing explainability and transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

