    <http://example.org/node/chunk52> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual cost of exploitation will have to remain mastered and compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk53> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose an approach allowing to optimize the costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected. 8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk54> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints In the framework of City of Belval policy of sustainable development, City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of City of Belval systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk55> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of the energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk56> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Modalities of deployment the project will have to be conducted in a progressive manner, with: a pilot phase on a limited scope, a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk57> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An accompaniment to the change and actions of training of the agents will be expected. 10." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk58> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Criteria of evaluation of the offers the offers will be evaluated with regard to the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution, compliance to the regulatory requirements, level of security, global cost of the proposed solution, taking into account of the environmental issues, capacity of innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the client's objectives to improve efficiency and quality of service, and considering the need for an intelligent assistance tool that integrates with existing systems and practices, what is our proposed project management methodology to ensure successful delivery and compliance with the City of Belval's requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk6> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution into the existing practices of the agents and not constitute a rupture in the agents modes of work. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk60> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., proposes a project management methodology based on Agile Scrum, which is one of our certified methodologies. a project management methodology based on Agile Scrum, which is one of our certified methodologies will allow our to deliver the intelligent assistance tool in an iterative and incremental manner, ensuring that our meet the City of Belval's requirements and integrate with the City of Belval's existing systems and practices. our will start by conducting an Inception & Design phase, where our will work closely with the client to understand the client specific needs and requirements. an Inception & Design phase, where we will work closely with the client to understand their specific needs and requirements will be followed by a Pilot / MVP phase, where our will develop a minimum viable product that can be tested and validated by the client. our will then proceed with a Full Rollout phase, where our will deploy the intelligent assistance tool to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with the City of Belval's requirements, our will maintain a RAID log, a Decision log, and a Change request process. our will also establish a Steering committee that will meet on a monthly basis to review progress and provide guidance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our will provide Weekly status reports and Quarterly executive reviews to keep the client informed. our dedicated change manager will work closely with the client to ensure a smooth transition and provide training to the agents on the intelligent assistance tool. our will also track user adoption and provide quick reference guides and in-person workshops as needed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of risk management, our will maintain a risk register and review a risk register bi-weekly. our have identified standard risk categories such as Technical, Financial, Regulatory, Operational, and Reputational, and our will work to mitigate standard risk categories such as Technical, Financial, Regulatory, Operational, and Reputational throughout the project. our believe that our proposed methodology, based on Agile Scrum and our experience in delivering similar projects, will ensure successful delivery and compliance with the City of Belval's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must integrate with existing system of information, business softwares, electronic management of documents, and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk65> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution should provide API-type interfaces, guarantee high availability (99.9%), and respond within 2 seconds to current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design the technical architecture to meet these requirements while ensuring data sovereignty and security?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To design a technical architecture that meets the specified requirements, we can leverage we expertise in AI/ML systems, Cloud architecture, API integration, Data engineering, and Cybersecurity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, for integrating with existing systems of information, business softwares, electronic management of documents, and user directories, we can utilize we experience with API standards such as REST, GraphQL, and SOAP, along with API gateways like Kong and Apigee. utilize will enable seamless communication between The solution and the various systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For high availability (99.9%) and fast response times (within 2 seconds), we can design a cloud-based architecture using providers like OVHcloud, Scaleway, or Outscale (SecNumCloud), where we have experience." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We can employ containerization using Docker and orchestration with Kubernetes (K8s) to ensure scalability and reliability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee data sovereignty and security, we will host the solution on an infrastructure of SecNumCloud type or equivalent, ensuring that all data is hosted exclusively within the European Union and protected appropriately using encryption and anonymization if necessary. we experience with security design patterns such as Zero-trust network architecture, VLAN segmentation, and mTLS between services will be crucial in safeguarding the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we can utilize we knowledge of identity providers like Active Directory/LDAP, Keycloak, and FranceConnect to manage user access securely." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For monitoring and ensuring the high availability of the system, tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and the ELK stack can be employed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, considering the importance of environmental footprint reduction, we will propose a solution that relies as much as possible on infrastructures with low carbon impact, aligning with we experience in environmental optimization and green hosting partners like OVHcloud and Scaleway (100% renewable)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these elements, we can design a technical architecture that not only meets the specified requirements but also prioritizes data sovereignty, security, and environmental sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval requires strict GDPR compliance, with data hosted exclusively in the EU, no transfer outside the EU, and sensitive data protected through encryption or anonymization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What measures can we implement to ensure we solution meets these regulatory requirements and provides explicability and transparency for the recommendations or proposals issued?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The City of Belval GDPR compliance requirements, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can leverage our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., existing certifications and expertise. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., are ISO 27001 certified, which demonstrates our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., commitment to information security management, including data protection. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., certification scope includes the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data residency, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can ensure that all data is hosted exclusively within the EU, aligning with The City of Belval requirement. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., do not have any information indicating that our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., would need to transfer data outside the EU for this project, which complies with the no-transfer rule." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To protect sensitive data, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can implement encryption and anonymization techniques." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., GDPR posture includes the use of anonymisation tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models. the use of anonymisation tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models ensures that personal data can be adequately protected." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding explicability and transparency for recommendations or proposals issued by our solution, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can provide detailed logs and explanations for the decisions made. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., audit and logging capabilities include all queries being logged with immutability ensured through append-only logging with SHA-256 hash chaining." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., have real-time SIEM integration using tools like Wazuh and Elastic SIEM, which can help in monitoring and providing insights into system activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further ensure transparency, we Data Protection Officer (DPO) is available at dpo@nexus-engineering.it to address any data protection concerns or questions The City of Belval may have. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., also conduct Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs), with an average duration of 3 weeks, to identify and mitigate risks associated with personal data processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing these measures, we can provide a solution that not only meets the GDPR compliance requirements but also offers explicability and transparency for the recommendations or proposals it issues, thereby ensuring trust and reliability in our AI-powered information system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires compliance with various regulatory frameworks, including GDPR, and adherence to specific standards such as SecNumCloud for hosting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

