    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, regarding GDPR compliance, we is aware of the importance of protecting data in an appropriate manner, using encryption and anonymization if necessary. we also ensure that all client data remains the sole property of the contracting authority." ;
