    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I must note that we do not have specific information about compliance with the SecNumCloud standard in we context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate potential legal risks, it is essential to conduct a thorough review of we subcontractors and ensure our subcontractors comply with GDPR and other relevant regulatory frameworks. we has a subcontractor vetting process that includes legal and financial due diligence, as well as exclusion grounds checks, which can help identify and manage potential legal risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding decision automation, we has a policy of not allowing automated decisions without human validation. a policy of not allowing automated decisions without human validation is aligned with the \"no_automated_decision_without_human_validation_policy\" mentioned in our context. we also have expertise in EU AI Act compliance, including awareness of prohibited AI practices and the importance of transparency obligations for limited-risk AI applications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure explicit validation by authorized professionals, we can propose a solution that includes human oversight and review mechanisms. a solution that includes human oversight and review mechanisms could involve integrating we AI-powered tools with existing systems to facilitate human validation of automated decisions or providing APIs for clients to integrate we solutions with clients own validation processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In summary, while there may be some gaps in we compliance with specific standards like SecNumCloud, we have a solid foundation for GDPR compliance and decision automation safeguards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By carefully reviewing our subcontractors, ensuring data hosting within the European Union, and implementing human validation mechanisms, we can mitigate legal risks and provide a compliant solution that meets regulatory requirements." ;
